<title>JAPAN: BOJ says to release 'tankan' survey on November 27.</title>
<headline>BOJ says to release 'tankan' survey on November 27.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Japan (BOJ) will release its &quot;tankan&quot; survey of corporate sentiment for November on November 27 at 11 a.m. (0200 GMT), the central bank said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
